OL,3,AWildlife park remains closed after
OL,4,Atiger attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA park spokesperson said their
OL,7,F"thoughts and heartfelt sympathies"
OL,8,Fremain with the man's family and
OL,9,Fconfirmed the Amur tiger, called Altai,
OL,10,Fremained in the enclosure and would not
OL,11,Fbe euthanised.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
